Found and Fixed the Presets Issue!
The problem was Railway's persistent volume mount! Here's what happened:

The Problem:
Railway mounts a persistent volume at /data/ to store your database file. When a volume is mounted, it overrides any files from git in that directory. So even though presets.json was in your repository, Railway's volume mount was hiding it!

