Excellent! I found the bug! 🐛

🔍 The Problem
The migration looked successful but the CREATE TABLE statements were failing with "incomplete input". The issue was inline comments in the SQL:

UNIQUE(container_id, copy_id)          -- Each copy can only be in container once
);

The parser was including the -- comment, which made SQLite treat everything after it (including the closing );) as a comment, causing "incomplete input" errors!

✅ The Fix
I updated the parser to:

Strip inline comments before processing each line
Add semicolons back when executing (was accidentally removing them)
Skip empty lines after comment removal
🚀 Try Again!
