Perfect! I've fixed the issue. The format dropdown was empty because of an ID naming collision:

The Problem
The format dropdown (<select>) had id="boxSetFormat"
The display paragraph in the box set details modal also had id="boxSetFormat"
When JavaScript tried to read the dropdown value with document.getElementById('boxSetFormat').value, it was accidentally grabbing the paragraph element instead of the select dropdown!

The Fix
Renamed the display paragraph to id="boxSetFormatDisplay"
Updated the JavaScript reference in showBoxSetDetails() function
The format dropdown now works correctly
